# McCoy, Not a Bricklayer (0/4): "Whenever McCoy or another Doctor you control enters, put a +1/+1 counter on each
# creature you control" (CR 603.6a, 201.5, 122.1). McCoy entering on turn 3 fires exactly once - McCoy itself is not
# "another Doctor" - so Memnite goes to 2/2 and McCoy to 1/5. Dr. Pulaski entering on turn 5 fires again: Memnite to
# 3/3, McCoy to 2/6, Pulaski to 3/3. Bot2's Grizzly Bears never takes a counter. One trigger more or less would fail a
# power line.

